      "docs": "Creates an Http Request Handler that gets routed through the additional handling of the ExternalRpcRegistry\n@param  InFunc   A delegate to be prepared for attachment to a route.\n@return An FHttpRequestHandler delegate object that can be assigned a route in RegisterHttpCallback"
